---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
const supabaseUrl = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_SUPABASE_URL ?? '';
const supabaseKey = import.meta.env.PUBLIC_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY ?? '';
---

<Layout title="Registrar-se — la Soci">

  <div class="bg-orange-500 text-white py-2 px-4 flex items-center justify-center gap-2 text-sm font-medium">
    <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 15v2m-6 4h12a2 2 0 002-2v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2zm10-10V7a4 4 0 00-8 0v4h8z"/>
    </svg>
    <span id="banner-text">Estàs en un entorn 100% segur</span>
  </div>

  <div class="min-h-screen bg-gray-50 py-10 px-4">
    <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">

      <div class="text-center mb-8">
        <a href="/"><span class="text-3xl font-bold text-orange-500">la</span><span class="text-3xl font-bold text-blue-900">Soci</span></a>
        <h1 class="text-2xl font-bold text-gray-800 mt-3" id="reg-title">Registra't</h1>
      </div>

      <div class="flex gap-8 items-start">

        <div class="hidden md:block w-64 bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-6 sticky top-24">
          <h2 class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-500 uppercase tracking-wide mb-4" id="sidebar-title">Procés de registre</h2>
          <div class="space-y-3" id="steps-sidebar"></div>
        </div>

        <div class="flex-1">

          <div class="h-3 bg-gray-200 rounded-full mb-6 overflow-hidden">
            <div id="progress-bar" class="h-full bg-green-500 rounded-full transition-all duration-500" style="width: 20%"></div>
          </div>

          <!-- STEP 1 -->
          <div id="step-1" class="step-panel bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-8">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-gray-100">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-orange-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-orange-500" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 8l7.89 5.26a2 2 0 002.22 0L21 8M5 19h14a2 2 0 002-2V7a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v10a2 2 0 002 2z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800" id="s1-title">Dades de contacte</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500" id="s1-sub">Les farem servir per enviar-te informació necessària</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-4 mb-6 flex gap-3">
              <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-amber-500 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
              </svg>
              <p class="text-sm text-amber-700" id="s1-info">Els demanem perquè puguis recuperar el procés en qualsevol moment</p>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-5">
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5" id="label-email">Correu electrònic *</label>
                  <input type="email" id="email" required class="form-input w-full px-4 py-3 border-2 border-orange-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-green-500 text-sm transition-colors" placeholder="nom@caixabank.com" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5" id="label-telefon">Mòbil</label>
                  <div class="flex gap-2">
                    <div class="flex items-center gap-1 border-2 border-orange-300 rounded-xl px-3 py-3 bg-white text-sm">
                      <span>🇪🇸</span><span class="text-gray-600">+34</span>
                    </div>
                    <input type="tel" id="telefon" class="form-input flex-1 px-4 py-3 border-2 border-orange-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-green-500 text-sm transition-colors" placeholder="666 000 000" />
                  </div>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="flex items-start gap-3 pt-2">
                <input type="checkbox" id="rgpd" class="mt-0.5 w-5 h-5 accent-orange-500 cursor-pointer flex-shrink-0" />
                <label for="rgpd" class="text-sm text-gray-600 cursor-pointer">
                  <span id="rgpd-text">Afirmo que he llegit i accepto la </span>
                  <button type="button" id="open-privacy" class="text-blue-600 hover:underline font-medium">informació bàsica sobre protecció de dades</button>
                </label>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 flex justify-end">
              <button type="button" onclick="nextStep(1)" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-xl transition text-sm">
                <span id="btn-continuar-1">Continuar</span>
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- STEP 2 -->
          <div id="step-2" class="step-panel hidden bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-8">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-gray-100">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-blue-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-blue-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800" id="s2-title">Dades personals</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500" id="s2-sub">Comprova que la informació és correcta</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-5">
              <div class="grid grid-cols-1 sm:grid-cols-2 gap-4">
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5" id="label-nombre">Nom *</label>
                  <input type="text" id="nombre" required class="form-input w-full px-4 py-3 border-2 border-orange-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-green-500 text-sm transition-colors" placeholder="Joan" />
                </div>
                <div>
                  <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5" id="label-apellidos">Cognoms *</label>
                  <input type="text" id="apellidos" required class="form-input w-full px-4 py-3 border-2 border-orange-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-green-500 text-sm transition-colors" placeholder="Garcia López" />
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5" id="label-dni">DNI *</label>
                <input type="text" id="dni" required maxlength="9" class="form-input w-full px-4 py-3 border-2 border-orange-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-green-500 text-sm uppercase transition-colors" placeholder="12345678A" />
                <p id="dni-error" class="text-red-500 text-xs mt-1 hidden"></p>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5" id="label-vinculacion">Vinculació *</label>
                <select id="vinculacion" required class="form-input w-full px-4 py-3 border-2 border-orange-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-green-500 text-sm bg-white transition-colors">
                  <option value="" id="opt-select">-- Selecciona --</option>
                  <option value="empleado" id="opt-empleado">Empleat/da CaixaBank</option>
                  <option value="jubilado" id="opt-jubilado">Jubilat/da CaixaBank</option>
                  <option value="beneficiario" id="opt-beneficiario">Beneficiari/a</option>
                  <option value="empleado_lasoci" id="opt-empleado-lasoci">Empleat/da LaSoci</option>
                </select>
              </div>
              <div id="titular-section" class="hidden bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-3">
                <p class="text-sm font-medium text-blue-800" id="label-buscar-titular">Busca el teu titular</p>
                <div class="relative">
                  <input type="text" id="buscar-titular" class="form-input w-full px-3 py-2.5 border-2 border-orange-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-green-500 text-sm transition-colors" placeholder="Escriu cognoms o nom..." />
                  <div id="titular-resultados" class="absolute z-10 w-full bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-lg mt-1 hidden max-h-48 overflow-y-auto"></div>
                </div>
                <div id="titular-selected" class="hidden bg-white border border-green-300 rounded-xl p-3">
                  <div class="flex items-center justify-between">
                    <div>
                      <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-gray-800" id="titular-nombre"></p>
                      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500" id="titular-vinculacion"></p>
                    </div>
                    <button type="button" onclick="clearTitular()" class="text-red-400 hover:text-red-600 text-xs">✕</button>
                  </div>
                </div>
                <input type="hidden" id="titular-dni" />
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 flex justify-between">
              <button type="button" onclick="prevStep(2)" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700 font-medium px-4 py-3 rounded-xl transition text-sm">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
                <span id="btn-anterior-2">Anterior</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" onclick="nextStep(2)" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-xl transition text-sm">
                <span id="btn-continuar-2">Continuar</span>
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- STEP 3 -->
          <div id="step-3" class="step-panel hidden bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-8">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-gray-100">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-green-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-green-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M3 10h18M7 15h1m4 0h1m-7 4h12a3 3 0 003-3V8a3 3 0 00-3-3H6a3 3 0 00-3 3v8a3 3 0 003 3z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800" id="s3-title">Dades bancàries</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500" id="s3-sub">Per gestionar la quota de soci (opcional)</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-5">

              <!-- Selector tipo IBAN — solo para beneficiarios -->
              <div id="iban-tipo-section" class="hidden bg-blue-50 border border-blue-200 rounded-xl p-4 space-y-3">
                <p class="text-sm font-semibold text-blue-800" id="label-iban-tipo">¿Qué cuenta usarás para la domiciliación?</p>
                <div class="space-y-2">
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border-2 border-transparent hover:border-orange-300 transition">
                    <input type="radio" name="iban_tipo" value="propio" checked class="accent-orange-500 w-4 h-4" id="radio-iban-propio" />
                    <div>
                      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800" id="opt-iban-propio-title">Mi propio IBAN</p>
                      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500" id="opt-iban-propio-sub">Introduce tu número de cuenta bancaria</p>
                    </div>
                  </label>
                  <label class="flex items-center gap-3 cursor-pointer p-3 bg-white rounded-xl border-2 border-transparent hover:border-orange-300 transition">
                    <input type="radio" name="iban_tipo" value="titular" class="accent-orange-500 w-4 h-4" id="radio-iban-titular" />
                    <div>
                      <p class="text-sm font-medium text-gray-800" id="opt-iban-titular-title">IBAN del titular (empleado/jubilado)</p>
                      <p class="text-xs text-gray-500" id="opt-iban-titular-sub">Se usará el IBAN registrado del titular</p>
                    </div>
                  </label>
                </div>
                <!-- Info IBAN del titular -->
                <div id="info-iban-titular" class="hidden bg-green-50 border border-green-200 rounded-xl p-3 space-y-1">
                  <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-800" id="info-titular-nombre-label">Titular:</p>
                  <p class="text-sm font-bold text-green-900" id="info-titular-nombre-val">—</p>
                  <p class="text-xs font-semibold text-green-800 mt-2" id="info-titular-iban-label">IBAN:</p>
                  <p class="text-sm font-mono text-green-900" id="info-titular-iban-val">—</p>
                </div>
                <!-- Aviso si titular no tiene IBAN -->
                <div id="aviso-sin-iban" class="hidden bg-amber-50 border border-amber-200 rounded-xl p-3 flex gap-2">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-amber-600 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                    <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/>
                  </svg>
                  <p class="text-xs text-amber-700" id="aviso-sin-iban-text">El titular no tiene IBAN registrado. El administrador se pondrá en contacto con él para solicitarlo.</p>
                </div>
              </div>

              <!-- Campo IBAN propio -->
              <div id="iban-field-section">
                <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5" id="label-iban">IBAN</label>
                <input type="text" id="iban" maxlength="34"
                  class="form-input w-full px-4 py-3 border-2 border-orange-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-green-500 text-sm uppercase tracking-wider transition-colors"
                  placeholder="ES00 0000 0000 0000 0000 0000" />
                <p id="iban-error" class="text-red-500 text-xs mt-1 hidden"></p>
                <p id="iban-ok" class="text-green-600 text-xs mt-1 hidden">✓ IBAN vàlid</p>
              </div>

              <div>
                <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5" id="label-idioma">Idioma preferit</label>
                <select id="idioma" class="form-input w-full px-4 py-3 border-2 border-orange-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-green-500 text-sm bg-white transition-colors">
                  <option value="es">🇪🇸 Español</option>
                  <option value="ca">🏴󠁥󠁳󠁣󠁴󠁿 Català</option>
                </select>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 flex justify-between">
              <button type="button" onclick="prevStep(3)" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700 font-medium px-4 py-3 rounded-xl transition text-sm">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
                <span id="btn-anterior-3">Anterior</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" onclick="nextStep(3)" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-xl transition text-sm">
                <span id="btn-continuar-3">Continuar</span>
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg>
              </button>
            </div>
          </div>

          <!-- STEP 4 -->
          <div id="step-4" class="step-panel hidden bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-sm p-8">
            <div class="flex items-start gap-4 mb-6 pb-6 border-b border-gray-100">
              <div class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-purple-100 flex items-center justify-center flex-shrink-0">
                <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-purple-600" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                  <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 7a2 2 0 012 2m4 0a6 6 0 01-7.743 5.743L11 17H9v2H7v2H4a1 1 0 01-1-1v-2.586a1 1 0 01.293-.707l5.964-5.964A6 6 0 1121 9z"/>
                </svg>
              </div>
              <div>
                <h3 class="text-lg font-bold text-gray-800" id="s4-title">Crea la teva contrasenya</h3>
                <p class="text-sm text-gray-500" id="s4-sub">Mínim 8 caràcters</p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="space-y-5">
              <div>
                <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5" id="label-pwd">Contrasenya *</label>
                <div class="relative">
                  <input type="password" id="password" required minlength="8" class="form-input w-full px-4 py-3 border-2 border-orange-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-green-500 text-sm pr-12 transition-colors" placeholder="Mínim 8 caràcters" />
                  <button type="button" id="toggle-pwd" class="absolute right-3 top-3 text-gray-400 hover:text-gray-600">
                    <svg class="w-5 h-5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 12a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/>
                      <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M2.458 12C3.732 7.943 7.523 5 12 5c4.478 0 8.268 2.943 9.542 7-1.274 4.057-5.064 7-9.542 7-4.477 0-8.268-2.943-9.542-7z"/>
                    </svg>
                  </button>
                </div>
              </div>
              <div>
                <label class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700 mb-1.5" id="label-pwd2">Repetir contrasenya *</label>
                <input type="password" id="password2" required class="form-input w-full px-4 py-3 border-2 border-orange-300 rounded-xl focus:outline-none focus:border-green-500 text-sm transition-colors" placeholder="••••••••" />
                <p id="pwd-error" class="text-red-500 text-xs mt-1 hidden"></p>
              </div>
            </div>
            <div class="mt-8 flex justify-between">
              <button type="button" onclick="prevStep(4)" class="flex items-center gap-2 text-gray-500 hover:text-gray-700 font-medium px-4 py-3 rounded-xl transition text-sm">
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M15 19l-7-7 7-7"/></svg>
                <span id="btn-anterior-4">Anterior</span>
              </button>
              <button type="button" onclick="submitForm()" class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-orange-500 hover:bg-orange-600 text-white font-semibold px-8 py-3 rounded-xl transition text-sm">
                <span id="btn-crear">Crear compte</span>
                <svg class="w-4 h-4" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
              </button>
            </div>
            <div id="reg-error" class="hidden mt-4 bg-red-50 border border-red-200 text-red-700 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm"></div>
            <div id="reg-success" class="hidden mt-4 bg-green-50 border border-green-200 text-green-700 px-4 py-3 rounded-xl text-sm"></div>
          </div>

          <p class="text-center text-sm text-gray-500 mt-6">
            <span id="ya-socio">Ja tens compte?</span>
            <a href="/socios/login" class="text-orange-500 hover:underline font-medium ml-1" id="link-login">Inicia sessió</a>
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- PRIVACY MODAL -->
  <div id="privacy-modal" class="fixed inset-0 z-50 hidden">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm"></div>
    <div class="relative z-10 flex items-center justify-center min-h-screen p-4">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-2xl shadow-2xl w-full max-w-2xl max-h-[90vh] flex flex-col">
        <div class="bg-blue-900 text-white px-6 py-4 rounded-t-2xl flex items-center justify-between flex-shrink-0">
          <div>
            <div class="text-xs font-medium text-blue-300 uppercase tracking-wide mb-1">PDF</div>
            <h3 class="font-bold text-lg" id="modal-title">Informació bàsica sobre protecció de dades</h3>
          </div>
          <button onclick="closePrivacy()" class="text-blue-200 hover:text-white ml-4">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M6 18L18 6M6 6l12 12"/></svg>
          </button>
        </div>
        <div class="bg-amber-50 border-b border-amber-200 px-6 py-3 flex items-center gap-2 flex-shrink-0">
          <p class="text-sm text-amber-700" id="modal-warning">Has d'arribar al final del document i prémer Acceptar</p>
        </div>
        <div id="privacy-content" class="overflow-y-auto flex-1 p-8 text-sm text-gray-700 leading-relaxed" onscroll="checkScroll()">
          <h4 class="text-base font-bold text-blue-900 mb-4" id="privacy-heading">INFORMACIÓN BÁSICA SOBRE PROTECCIÓN DE DATOS</h4>
          <div id="privacy-body-es">
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">Responsable del tratamiento</p>
            <p class="mb-4">Identidad: la Soci — Asociación del Personal de CaixaBank</p>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">¿Por qué y para qué tratamos sus datos?</p>
            <p class="mb-4">La asociación trata sus datos personales con las siguientes finalidades:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-2">
              <li>Gestionar su condición de socio/a, incluyendo el cobro de cuotas y la prestación de servicios asociativos.</li>
              <li>Cumplir las obligaciones legales aplicables a las asociaciones sin ánimo de lucro.</li>
              <li>Enviar comunicaciones relacionadas con las actividades, secciones y eventos de la asociación.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">¿Cuánto tiempo conservaremos sus datos?</p>
            <p class="mb-4">Sus datos se conservarán mientras mantenga la condición de socio/a y, posteriormente, durante los plazos legalmente establecidos.</p>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">¿Cuáles son sus derechos?</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-2">
              <li>Derecho de acceso, rectificación, supresión, oposición y portabilidad.</li>
              <li>Para ejercer sus derechos, puede contactar con nosotros a través de la sección de contacto de la web.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">Derecho a presentar una reclamación</p>
            <p class="mb-8">Tiene derecho a presentar una reclamación ante la Agencia Española de Protección de Datos (www.aepd.es).</p>
          </div>
          <div id="privacy-body-ca" class="hidden">
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">Responsable del tractament</p>
            <p class="mb-4">Identitat: la Soci — Associació del Personal de CaixaBank</p>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">Per què i per a què tractem les seves dades?</p>
            <p class="mb-4">L'associació tracta les seves dades personals amb les finalitats següents:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-2">
              <li>Gestionar la seva condició de soci/sòcia, incloent-hi el cobrament de quotes i la prestació de serveis associatius.</li>
              <li>Complir les obligacions legals aplicables a les associacions sense ànim de lucre.</li>
              <li>Enviar comunicacions relacionades amb les activitats, seccions i esdeveniments de l'associació.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">Quant de temps conservarem les seves dades?</p>
            <p class="mb-4">Les seves dades es conservaran mentre mantingui la condició de soci/sòcia i, posteriorment, durant els terminis legalment establerts.</p>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">Quins són els seus drets?</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-2">
              <li>Dret d'accés, rectificació, supressió, oposició i portabilitat.</li>
              <li>Per exercir els seus drets, pot contactar amb nosaltres a través de la secció de contacte de la web.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">Dret a presentar una reclamació</p>
            <p class="mb-8">Té dret a presentar una reclamació davant l'Agència Espanyola de Protecció de Dades (www.aepd.es).</p>
          </div>
          <div id="privacy-body-en" class="hidden">
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">Data Controller</p>
            <p class="mb-4">Identity: la Soci — CaixaBank Staff Association</p>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">Why and for what purpose do we process your data?</p>
            <p class="mb-4">The association processes your personal data for the following purposes:</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-2">
              <li>Managing your membership, including collection of fees and provision of association services.</li>
              <li>Complying with legal obligations applicable to non-profit associations.</li>
              <li>Sending communications related to the association's activities, sections and events.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">How long will we keep your data?</p>
            <p class="mb-4">Your data will be kept for as long as you remain a member and, thereafter, for the legally established periods.</p>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">What are your rights?</p>
            <ul class="list-disc pl-5 mb-4 space-y-2">
              <li>Right of access, rectification, erasure, objection and portability.</li>
              <li>To exercise your rights, you can contact us through the contact section of the website.</li>
            </ul>
            <p class="font-semibold mb-2">Right to lodge a complaint</p>
            <p class="mb-8">You have the right to lodge a complaint with the Spanish Data Protection Agency (www.aepd.es).</p>
          </div>
